# Binary fixtures must never be line-ending normalized. These small reportlab
# PDFs contain no NUL bytes, so git's autocrlf would misdetect them as text and
# rewrite LF→CRLF on checkout — corrupting the xref byte offsets so pdfplumber
# can no longer open them on a fresh clone. Mark them binary (no eol conversion,
# no text diff). Excel fixtures are zip archives but are marked for the same
# guarantee of byte-exact checkout.
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
